{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "sectional_lr2m_low_triangle",
    "description": "True when the mean volume of section j sits in the LOWER third of the section, x <= 1/3 with x = sectional_lr2m_position the mean's fractional position: a linear number density on [vb[j], vb[j+1]] with that mean would go negative at the upper edge, so the reconstruction is cut back to a triangle on [vb[j], vb[j] + 3 (vbar - vb[j])] that vanishes at its top (sectional_lr2m_support_top). The test has no tolerance, and so is exclusive of sectional_lr2m_high_triangle: the reconstruction is continuous across x = 1/3 (the full-section profile there already vanishes at the top), so which branch an exact tie takes is immaterial. MOSAIC (move_sections_calc_masnumadvect) writes the same test as vbar/vb[j] <= 1.0001 + gamma/3 with gamma = vb[j+1]/vb[j] - 1, an absolute 1e-4 on the volume RATIO; in position units that is a margin of 1e-4/gamma, which is harmless for MOSAIC's own sections (gamma = 7) but swallows the whole upper third once gamma < ~6e-4 and then yields a negative density at the lower edge. For non-overlapping margins the two forms give the same reconstruction, since inside MOSAIC's margin its clamped support is the full section.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:sectional_volume_1d",
      "op:advection",
      "order:2",
      "scheme:linear-discrete"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R. A., Easter, R. C., Fast, J. D., & Peters, L. K. (2008). Model for Simulating Aerosol Interactions and Chemistry (MOSAIC). Journal of Geophysical Research, 113, D13204.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2007JD008782"
      },
      {
        "citation": "WRF-Chem v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_movesect.F, subroutines move_sections_calc_masnumadvect and move_sections_apply_moves (R. C. Easter), the 'linear-discrete' / mass-number-advection section-moving algorithm (msectional = 20)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "./sectional_lr2m_position.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "sectional_lr2m_low_triangle": {
      "params": ["N", "V", "c", "j"],
      "body": {
        "op": "<=",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "sectional_lr2m_position",
            "bindings": {"N": "N", "V": "V", "c": "c", "j": "j"}
          },
          {"op": "/", "args": [1, 3]}
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
